# Top-level dependencies of the pompeu package. Pinned, with everything they pull in, in
# requirements.lock -- install from the lock, edit this file, then regenerate the lock:
#
#     python -m venv .venv && .venv/Scripts/pip install -r requirements.in   (Windows; bin/ elsewhere)
#     .venv/Scripts/pip freeze > requirements.lock
#
# Python 3.11. Later stages add their own lines here (torch for A7).
